### Watchdog Timer (WDT) — Prevent Silent Resets
> ⚠️ **CRITICAL AI INSTRUCTION:** The ESP-IDF Task Watchdog (TWDT) will reset the board if a task holds the CPU without yielding for more than ~5 seconds. NEVER write a `while(1)` loop without a `vTaskDelay`.

CPU without yielding for more than ~5 seconds. NEVER write a `while(1)` loop without a `vTaskDelay`.  Even a `vTaskDelay(pdMS_TO_TICKS(1))` is sufficient to pet the watchdog.

```c
